PokemonLeague_LoreleisRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "Welcome to the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
    .string "I am AGATHA of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "I hear you've been taking orders\n"
    .string "from that old fool, OAK.\p"
    .string "I'll show you that true power\n"
    .string "doesn't come from a POKéDEX!\p"
    .string "My GHOST and POISON POKéMON will\n"
    .string "drag you into the shadows!\p"
    .string "Hahaha!\n"
    .string "Are you ready?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

